    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:narrativeTimeAxis and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:narrativeTimeAxis (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:narrativeTimeAxisFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:narrativeTimeAxis ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .
gmeow:positionFrameFunctionality
    a logic:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/narrative> ;
    rdfs:label "positionFrame is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:positionFrame is functional: a NarrativePosition is expressed in exactly one narrative time frame — the single coordinate system that gives its ordinal and label meaning — since a position without its one frame is the bare-integer anti-pattern the class exists to forbid. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:positionFrame ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:positionFrame ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:positionFrame names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:positionFrame, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:positionFrame and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:positionFrame (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:positionFrameFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:positionFrame ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .
gmeow:positionOrdinalFunctionality
    a logic:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/narrative> ;
    rdfs:label "positionOrdinal is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:positionOrdinal is functional: a NarrativePosition has exactly one ordinal coordinate within its frame, so a chapter index and a fabula sequence number for the same diegetic moment live on different positions in different frames, never as two ordinals on one position."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:positionOrdinal ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:positionOrdinal ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:positionOrdinal names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:positionOrdinal, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:positionOrdinal and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:positionOrdinal (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:positionOrdinalFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:positionOrdinal ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .
gmeow:samplePositionFunctionality
    a logic:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/narrative> ;
    rdfs:label "samplePosition is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:samplePosition is functional: an ArcSample reads at exactly one narrative position — the single WHERE that fixes the sample — since a sample without a position is not a sample, and a reading taken at another position is another sample."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:samplePosition ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:samplePosition ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:samplePosition names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:samplePosition, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:samplePosition and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:samplePosition (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:samplePositionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:samplePosition ."@x-gmeow-english ;
