gmeow:sampleStateFunctionality
    a logic:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/narrative> ;
    rdfs:label "sampleState is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sampleState is functional: an ArcSample records exactly one read state by IRI, so a blended reading at one position resolves into several samples sharing a vantage rather than one sample carrying several states — one cell, one state."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:sampleState ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:sampleState ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:sampleState names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:sampleState, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:sampleState and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:sampleState (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "gmeow:sampleStateFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:sampleState ."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxABox .
gmeow:sampleSubjectFunctionality
    a logic:NamedIndividual ,
        logic:PropertyCharacteristicAssertion ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/narrative> ;
    rdfs:label "sampleSubject is functional"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sampleSubject is functional: an ArcSample reads exactly one subject — the single frame-scoped character or diegetic entity it observes — so a joint reading of two characters is two samples, not one sample with two subjects."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:sampleSubject ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:sampleSubject ;
